<title>GERMANY: Deutsche Hypo offers profit-sharing certificates.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Hypo offers profit-sharing certificates.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Deutsche Hypothekenbank said on Thursday that it was issuing 260 million marks in profit-sharing certificates due June 30, 1998.</p>
<p>Bids for the paper, which has a coupon of 6.875 percent and an offer price of 99.80 percent, will be taken until July 29, Deutsche Hypo said in statement.</p>
<p>The subscription ratio is one for 10, meaning that for every 10 shares with a nominal value of 50 marks, certificates with a nominal value of 1,000 marks can be taken up.</p>
<p>-- Kate Kelland, Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
